#: includes/abilities.php:1656
msgid "Free-text search over the reference TITLE only. It is WordPress core search, which reads post_title, post_excerpt and post_content — and this plugin holds the descriptive text in ACF fields with post_content empty, so a term appearing in the short description will NOT be found here, and an empty result is not evidence that nothing matches. To search those, filter by the axes that are indexed."
msgstr ""

